B.bso=s(["Apical 4-chamber view","Make a 5-chamber view by tilting slightly anterior","Add colour Doppler to visualise both inflow AND outflow jets simultaneously","Place PWD gate inside LV at intersection of both jets","Gate more toward interventricular septal wall","IVRT = time from aortic valve closure to mitral valve opening","Measure from end of ejection signal to start of E wave"],t.s)
