B.bmx=s(["Parasternal short axis view at papillary muscle level","1 O'clock, apical tilt","LV should appear as a circle in cross-section normally","Identify IVS position and shape","Measure D2 (vertical diameter \u2014 through IVS midpoint and LV posterior free wall)","Measure D1 (horizontal diameter \u2014 perpendicular to D2)","Eccentricity Index = D1/D2"],t.s)
