B.bn7=s(["Heart","~3\u20136","~5\u20138","Highest risk for major structural defects (e.g., conotruncal, septal). Minor structural/conduction issues still possible to ~8\u201310 wks conceptional (~10\u201312 wks GA)."],t.s)
